    "description": "### Overview\\nDemotes the webhook dispatch failure log from \`error\` to \`warn\` per\\nOPS-91. Only the level moves: the structured fields and the sanitized 500\\nresponse are untouched, so the failure is still recorded and still\\nalertable on a sustained rate.\\n\\n### Changelog\\n- \`webhook.ts\` — \`log.error\` -> \`log.warn\` on the dispatch catch, with a\\n  comment recording the ADR 0034 #5 reasoning.\\n- \`webhook.test.ts\` — the logging test now expects \`warn\`.\\n\\n### Verification\\n- \`pnpm -C packages/api test\` — green.\\n",
